<title>SOUTH AFRICA: SAfrica Wheat Board offers 50,000 T wheat for sale.</title>
<headline>SAfrica Wheat Board offers 50,000 T wheat for sale.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Africa's Wheat Board said on Thursday it was offering 49,756 tonnes of wheat for sale and delivery before August 31.</p>
<p>The wheat is being offered for sale domestically or for export from various depots around the country.</p>
<p>The tender closes on July 18.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
